**Token Refresh Flow:**
```
1. Initial login returns: access_token (10 min), refresh_token (30 days)
2. Access token expires → Client uses refresh_token
3. Server validates refresh_token and issues new access_token
4. Refresh token stored securely (HttpOnly cookie, no JavaScript access)
```

